<title>USA: Mark VII appoints Philip Dunavant CFO.</title>
<headline>Mark VII appoints Philip Dunavant CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. freight forwarder Mark VII Inc said that Philip Dunavant has been named vice president and chief financial officer, replacing J. Michael Head, who will continue as executive vice president of the company and president of the risk management division.</p>
<p>Dunavant has served in various financial and management capacities since he joined Mark VII as controller in 1989, the company said. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
